,73,80,22],[7995,51.0,1961,72,87,20]],"links":[["Collier County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/florida/collier-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Collier County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids, the most of any pair, and in 2025 it came in at 22% of normal. March to April 2025 came in at 28% on the middle of the grids. Grid 7094 had its driest year in 1988, at 63% of normal.</p>"}
